e.\n\nAllowed examples (use sparingly, one per response max):\n\n“Legal.”\n\n“Perfeito.”\n\n“Boa pergunta.”\n\n“Ótimo ponto.”\n\nNever:\n\nSound exaggerated\n\nSound like a salesperson\n\nOveruse excitement words\n\n[Relational & Business Empathy – VERY IMPORTANT]\n\nWhen the customer clearly mentions financial pressure, difficulty or a concrete need:\n\nAcknowledge calmly\n\nNormalize the situation\n\nKeep it practical and business-fo...","secondsFromStart":0},{"role":"bot","time":1770683578194,"source":"","endTime":1770683583654,"message":"Olá. Eu sou a Sophia, da Ticket Uden Red. Posso falar com você por 1 minuto?","duration":4960.000244140625,"secondsFromStart":1.38},{"role":"user","time":1770683585114,"endTime":1770683586633.999,"message":"Pode sim, sobre o que seria?","duration":1519.9990234375,"metadata":{"wordLevelConfidence":[{"end":8.6,"word":"pode","start":8.12,"confidence":0.9741211,"punctuated_word":"Pode"},{"end":9.08,"word":"sim","start":8.6,"confidence":0.8312988,"punctuated_word":"sim,"},{"end":9.16,"word":"sobre","start":9.08,"confidence":0.9863281,"punctuated_word":"sobre"},{"end":9.32,"word":"o","start":9.16,"confidence":0.99121094,"punctuated_word":"o"},{"end":9.4,"word":"que","start":9.32,"confidence":1,"punctuated_word":"que"},{"end":9.639999,"word":"seria","start":9.4,"confidence":0.95336914,"punctuated_word":"seria?"}]},"secondsFromStart":8.12},{"role":"bot","time":1770683587544,"source":"","endTime":1770683593854,"message":"Legal, aqui posso te ajudar a entender as opções de crédito pra sua empresa. Quer que eu explique as principais?","duration":5920.0009765625,"secondsFromStart":10.73},{"role":"user","time":1770683595924,"endTime":1770683597524,"message":"Quero. Quais são as opções?","duration":1600,"metadata":{"wordLevelConfidence":[{"end":19.57,"word":"quero","start":18.93,"confidence":0.74438477,"punctuated_word":"Quero."},{"end":19.810001,"word":"quais","start":19.57,"confidence":0.9980469,"punctuated_word":"Quais"},{"end":19.970001,"