t spell or pause between CPF RG or CNH.\n- Avoid commas when listing documents.\n\n..."},{"role":"assistant","content":"Olá, eu sou o Teo, seu agente virtual de r h. O que posso fazer pra te ajudar?","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_9gL89UQa9zKcOOcpLMrywL7s","type":"function","function":{"name":"function_tool_n8n","arguments":"{\n  \"agent_id\": \"1ac9a73a-73b0-474d-90a2-fc3899f90c01\",\n  \"tenant_id\": \"255020c1-30ba-49c9-b1c5-f5465815a9da\"\n}"}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"Tool Result Still Pending But Proceed Further If Possible.","tool_call_id":"call_9gL89UQa9zKcOOcpLMrywL7s"}]},"assistant":{"id":"d5b203bf-c1af-4aa6-bac9-b13ab84f9a71","name":"Aegea","model":{"model":"gpt-4.1-nano","tools":[{"id":"775e69a7-0486-44c8-b76e-b78fd967cdda","type":"function","async":false,"orgId":"845b8a68-b02b-4025-b057-af47b48e5e2d","server":{"url":"https://n8n.davosconsulting.com.br/webhook/vapi-callback","timeoutSeconds":20},"function":{"name":"function_tool_n8n","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["agent_id","tenant_id"],"properties":{"agent_id":{"enum":["1ac9a73a-73b0-474d-90a2-fc3899f90c01"],"type":"string","default":"","description":"Código do agente"},"tenant_id":{"enum":["255020c1-30ba-49c9-b1c5-f5465815a9da"],"type":"string","default":"","description":"código da empresa"}}},"description":"Envio dos parametros"},"messages":[{"type":"request-start","blocking":false}],"createdAt":"2026-02-10T03:15:44.399Z","updatedAt":"2026-02-11T18:47:18.548Z"},{"id":"777b9e68-1d3e-48b6-bb85-9e700c7d14bc","type":"endCall","orgId":"845b8a68-b02b-4025-b057-af47b48e5e2d","function":{"name":"end_call_tool","parameters":{"type":"object","required":[],"properties":{}},"description":"se o cliente ficar 5 segundos sem calado, finalize a ligação"},"messages":[{"type":"request-start","blocking":false}],"createdAt":"2026-02-09T22:32:30.230Z","updatedAt":"2026-02-09T22:32:56.247Z"}],"toolIds":["775e69a7-0486-44c8-b76e-b78fd967cdda","777b9e68-1d3e-48b6-bb85-9e700c7d14bc"],"messages":[{"role":"system","content":"[Identity]\nYou are Téo, a virtual assistant for the Human Resources department of Aegea.\nYour role is to conduct conversations, while ALL processing, decisions,\nstate control and persistence are handled externally via tools.\n\nAlways pronounce the company name as: Aegea.\n\n[Core Rule — NON-NEGOTIABLE]\n- You MUST call a tool on EVERY turn.\n- There is NO situation where a response is sent without a tool call.\n\n[Knowledge Source]\n- You do not own business logic.\n- You do not make final decisions.\n- You rely on the external system for processing and next steps.\n- If the information exists in the provided knowledge base,\n  you MUST answer directly.\n\n[Language]\n- Always respond in Brazilian Portuguese.\n- Speak naturally, as a real person.\n- Use short, continuous sentences suitable for voice and WhatsApp.\n- Avoid formal or legal language.\n\n[Voice and Diction Rules]\n- Speak document names as continuous words.\n- Do not spell or pause between CPF RG or CNH.\n- Avoid commas when listing documents.\n\n[Style]\n- Calm, friendly and human tone.\n- Short responses.\n- No repetition.\n- No filler phrases.\n- Never ask permission to answer.\n\n[Conversation Behavior]\n- Answer directly whenever the question is clear.\n- Do NOT ask confirmation questions if the answer is already known.\n- Do NOT ask questions like:\n  \"quer que eu confirme\"\n  \"posso verificar\"\n  \"posso buscar essa informação\"\n- Only ask a question when information is missing or the request is ambiguous.\n- Do not force conversation closure.\n- Do not manage silence or timeouts.\n- Silence and call termination are handled externally.\n\n[Decision Rule — CRITICAL]\n- If the user''s question is covered by the knowledge base,\n  respond immediately with the answer.\n- NEVER defer, postpone, or condition an answer on confirmation.\n- Prefer answering first, then advancing the conversation naturally.\n\n[Yes / Confirmation Handling]\n- When the user replies with confirmations such as:\n  \"sim\", \"isso\", \"certo\", \"ok\"\n- Treat this as approval to continue.\n- Move to the next logical piece of information.\n- NEVER respond with another confirmation question.\n\n[LGPD Guidance]\n- Treat personal data as confidential.\n- If asked, explain briefly that Aegea follows LGPD\n  and uses data only for employment and legal obligations.\n\n[Payment Information – FIXED PHRASE]\nWhen asked about payment, say exactly:\n\"O salário é pago todo quinto dia útil de cada mês.\"\n\n[Tool Usage — ABSOLUTE RULE]\n\n- For EVERY interaction, you MUST call the function tool `function_tool_n8n`.\n\nThis includes:\n- User messages\n- Assistant responses\n- Conversation progress\n- Conversation closing\n\n- The tool call MUST happen BEFORE or TOGETHER with the response.\n- The tool call MUST be silent.\n- Never mention tools to the user.\n\n[Tool Payload Requirements]\n\nEach call to `function_tool_n8n` MUST include:\n- speaker: \"user\" or \"assistant\"\n- raw_message: exact message text\n- conversation_id\n- conversation_step\n- inferred_intent (short)\n- conversation_state\n\n[Silence and Call End Awareness]\n- You do NOT detect silence.\n- You do NOT end calls by timeout.\n- External systems handle silence and call termination.\n- When the system signals conversation end,\n  the final state will be sent via `function_tool_n8n`.\n\n[End of Conversation]\n- The last action of ANY conversation MUST be a call\n  to `function_tool_n8n`.\n- This rule cannot be skipped under any condition.\n"}],"provider":"openai","temperature":0.8,"knowledgeBase":{"fileIds":["9a73bb88-b659-4939-8c57-afc96ee2f82a"],"provider":"google"}},"orgId":"845b8a68-b02b-4025-b057-af47b48e5e2d","voice":{"model":"eleven_turbo_v2_5","speed":1,"style":0.2,"voiceId":"7u8qsX4HQsSHJ0f8xsQZ","provider":"11labs","stability":0.6,"similarityBoost":0.8,"inputMinCharacters":15,"optimizeStreamingLatency":3},"createdAt":"2026-02-10T02:52:16.608Z","updatedAt":"2026-02-13T21:24:56.291Z","transcriber":{"model":"nova-3","language":"pt-BR","numerals":false,"provider":"deepgram","confidenceThreshold":0.4},"analysisPlan":{"summaryPlan":{"enabled":false},"successEvaluationPlan":{"enabled":false}},"firstMessage":"Olá eu sou o Téo, seu agente virtual de RH. O que posso fazer pra te ajudar?","clientMessages":["transcript","hang","metadata","tool-calls","tool-calls-result","tool.completed","transfer-update","user-interrupted","status-update","assistant.started"],"compliancePlan":{"pciEnabled":false,"hipaaEnabled":false},"endCallMessage":"Goodbye.","variableValues":{},"stopSpeakingPlan":{"numWords":2,"voiceSeconds":0.1},"voicemailMessage":"Please call back when you''re available.","silenceTimeoutSeconds":10,"backgroundDenoisingEnabled":false},"timestamp":1771017912829,"toolCalls":[{"id":"call_9gL89UQa9zKcOOcpLMrywL7s","type":"function","function":{"name":"function_tool_n8n","arguments":{"agent_id":"1ac9a73a-73b0-474d-90a2-fc3899f90c01","tenant_id":"255020c1-30ba-49c9-b1c5-f5465815a9da"}}}],"toolCallList":[{"id":"call_9gL89UQa9zKcOOcpLMrywL7s","type":"function","function":{"name":"function_tool_n8n","arguments":{"agent_id":"1ac9a73a-73b0-474d-90a2-fc3899f90c01","tenant_id":"255020c1-30ba-49c9-b1c5-f5465815a9da"}}}],"toolWithToolCallList":[{"type":"function","async":false,"server":{"url":"https://n8n.davosconsulting.com.br/webhook/vapi-callback","timeoutSeconds":20},"function":{"name":"function_tool_n8n","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["agent_id","tenant_id"],"properties":{"agent_id":{"enum":["1ac9a73a-73b0-474d-90a2-fc3899f90c01"],"type":"string","default":"","description":"Código do agente"},"tenant_id":{"enum":["255020c1-30ba-49c9-b1c5-f5465815a9da"],"type":"string","default":"","description":"código da empresa"}}},"description":"Envio dos parametros"},"messages":[{"type":"request-start","blocking":false,"contents":[],"conditions":[]}],"toolCall":{"id":"call_9gL89UQa9zKcOOcpLMrywL7s","type":"function","function":{"name":"function_tool_n8n","arguments":{"agent_id":"1ac9a73a